[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6316746338","html_url":"https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/issues/6327#issuecomment-6316746338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/6327","id":6316746338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCact888AAAABeIHmYg","user":{"login":"manuelschoene","id":185798972,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxMRPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185798972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene","html_url":"https://github.com/manuelschoene","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T13:03:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:03:36Z","body":"I am going to open a PR on this issue with an implementation shortly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6316746338/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6366034355","html_url":"https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/issues/6327#issuecomment-6366034355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/6327","id":6366034355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCact888AAAABe3H5sw","user":{"login":"manuelschoene","id":185798972,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxMRPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185798972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene","html_url":"https://github.com/manuelschoene","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuelschoene/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-23T13:30:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:30:01Z","body":"@leaanthony There is no direct way of opening the system tray menu from the application side on Linux. The \"com.canonical.item.activation.requested\" signal should be used based on its intention for exactly this scenario. From my testing and some reading, most desktops ignore the signal to prevent focus stealing. I see three possible solutions:\n\n1. The implementation fires the \"com.canonical.item.activation.requested\" signal nonetheless. It should be documented that this functionality may not work on certain desktops.\n2. Instead of trying to open the menu, the status of the StatusNotifierItem can be changed to \"NeedsAttention\". This will show some kind of animation on the system tray icon. On KDE, a pulse animation is used. This won't open the menu, but signal to the user of the application that the menu should be opened.\n3. The openMenu() method could just swallow the call and log that this functionality is not supported on Linux.\n\nThe decision is yours. Let me know what behavior you prefer, and I will implement it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wailsapp/wails/issues/comments/6366034355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]